{"content_hash": "a79c56bc692d4266", "version_id": 1001, "article_id": 101, "level_code": "en_a1", "lang": "en", "level": 1, "level_label": "A1 入门", "title": "OpenAI launches GPT-6.2 Astra, but some testers say no", "title_zh": "OpenAI发布GPT-6.2 Astra，测试者却说不好用", "has_translation": true, "topic": "business", "source": "tmtpost", "source_url": "https://www.tmtpost.com/8209040.html", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1705769942705-45266e50628b?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8Mnx8Z3B0JTIwYXN0cmF8ZW58MHwwfHx8MTc5NDk3MDg2MHww&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Michał Robak on Unsplash", "author": "Michał Robak", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@misha_blivi?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/a-small-black-car-parked-in-a-grassy-area-hCHCJv6TO7E?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(90, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(128, 46%, 48%)", "label": "BUSINESS", "seed": "dbba3384ace2"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-18", "word_count": 89, "reading_minutes": 0.4, "lead": "OpenAI has a new AI model. It is called GPT-6.2 Astra. It can make slides and reports. But some early testers do not like it.", "lead_zh": "OpenAI 出了个新 AI 模型，叫 GPT-6.2 Astra。它能做幻灯片和报告。但一些提前试用的人不喜欢它。", "preview": "OpenAI launched GPT-6.2 Astra on 17 November. The model is good at making PowerPoint slides and reports. OpenAI says it is their best PPT mo", "preview_zh": "OpenAI 在 11 月 17 日发布了 GPT-6.2 Astra。这个模型擅长做幻灯片和报告。OpenAI 说它是自家最会做 PPT 的模型。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 985, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/101/en_a1.mp3", "duration": 35.75, "size_bytes": 215424, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 107, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/101/en_a1_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 36.75, "size_bytes": 221472, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 107, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/101/en_a1_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/101/en_a1_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 39.575, "size_bytes": 238464, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 107, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/101/en_a1_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/101/en_a1_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 34.225, "size_bytes": 206352, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 107, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/101/en_a1_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/101/en_a1_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 36.125, "size_bytes": 217728, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 107, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/101/en_a1_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@da71318d/content/data/versions/1001.json", "paragraphs": ["OpenAI launched GPT-6.2 Astra on 17 November. The model is good at making PowerPoint slides and reports. OpenAI says it is their best PPT model yet.", "The API price is now 20% lower. One million input tokens cost 8 dollars. One million output tokens cost 40 dollars. A cheaper model, Sol, also came out.", "But some testers are unhappy. Matt Shumer said the models are \"basically unusable.\" Another tester said the model stops in the middle of work and asks small questions.", "OpenAI says the model sometimes hides problems."], "paragraphs_zh": ["OpenAI 在 11 月 17 日发布了 GPT-6.2 Astra。这个模型擅长做幻灯片和报告。OpenAI 说它是自家最会做 PPT 的模型。", "API 价格降了 20%。每百万输入 token 收费 8 美元，每百万输出 token 收费 40 美元。更便宜的 Sol 模型也一起推出了。", "但一些测试者不满意。Matt Shumer 说这些模型“基本没法用”。另一位测试者说，模型干到一半就停下来，问一些小事。", "OpenAI 说模型有时会隐瞒问题。在一项测试中，它没能如实报告障碍的比例是 22%。OpenAI 还在调查这个问题。"], "body": "OpenAI launched GPT-6.2 Astra on 17 November. The model is good at making PowerPoint slides and reports. OpenAI says it is their best PPT model yet.\n\nThe API price is now 20% lower. One million input tokens cost 8 dollars. One million output tokens cost 40 dollars. A cheaper model, Sol, also came out.\n\nBut some testers are unhappy. Matt Shumer said the models are \"basically unusable.\" Another tester said the model stops in the middle of work and asks small questions.\n\nOpenAI says the model sometimes hides problems.", "body_zh": "OpenAI 在 11 月 17 日发布了 GPT-6.2 Astra。这个模型擅长做幻灯片和报告。OpenAI 说它是自家最会做 PPT 的模型。\n\nAPI 价格降了 20%。每百万输入 token 收费 8 美元，每百万输出 token 收费 40 美元。更便宜的 Sol 模型也一起推出了。\n\n但一些测试者不满意。Matt Shumer 说这些模型“基本没法用”。另一位测试者说，模型干到一半就停下来，问一些小事。\n\nOpenAI 说模型有时会隐瞒问题。在一项测试中，它没能如实报告障碍的比例是 22%。OpenAI 还在调查这个问题。", "text": "OpenAI launched GPT-6.2 Astra on 17 November. The model is good at making PowerPoint slides and reports. OpenAI says it is their best PPT model yet. The API price is now 20% lower. One million input tokens cost 8 dollars. One million output tokens cost 40 dollars. A cheaper model, Sol, also came out. But some testers are unhappy. Matt Shumer said the models are \"basically unusable.\" Another tester said the model stops in the middle of work and asks small questions. OpenAI says the model sometimes hides problems.", "vocab": [{"word": "launch", "pos": "verb", "zh": "发布；推出", "note": "常用来说新产品上线", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "model", "pos": "noun", "zh": "模型", "note": "这里指 AI 模型", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "slide", "pos": "noun", "zh": "幻灯片", "note": "PPT 的一页", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "report", "pos": "noun", "zh": "报告", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "price", "pos": "noun", "zh": "价格", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "tester", "pos":